# Directive Status History

Append-only. Reviewer-owned (write access, alongside `coding/tasks_finished.md`
and `.friday/active/harness/review/`). Every directive ever tracked in `.friday/active/harness/status.md`
ends up here exactly once, in the same close-out pass that marks it `done` and deletes
`.friday/active/harness/plans/directives/<ID>.md` (rule 3 / rule 13). This is the durable
record that survives the directive file itself being gitignored/removed —
